From 799a668da2ec0ab024c49fa155b62cc77b4aadcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dameng <dameng@local>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 23:19:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] EDBT v4 B1: observation-only placement decision/operator
 trace (--placement_trace, default off)

- PlacementOptions.placement_trace (default false) + JOB CLI flag
- decision_trace.csv: one row per considered segment per daemon cycle
  (schemas/decision_trace.schema.json). Records v3 mapper semantics honestly
  at this commit (boundary overshoot visible); raw features, all four weights
  and weighted terms emitted separately so every row is recomputable to 1e-9.
- operator_segment_trace.csv: plan_reference_only rows (no per-execution
  attribution under clients=10; measured traffic fields empty by design)
- timed-phase anchors in Hyrise singleton (warmup/timed_first_half/
  timed_second_half labels); PlanAnalyzer operator-mask accumulation gated
  on the trace flag; trace run identity from EDBT_V4_RUN_ID/EDBT_V4_REP
- with the flag off every added branch is inert; trace-off equivalence vs
  base commit 0f182ad07 proven before the B2 mapper change
